body: |2-
  lentils + (split peas?), about 50/50
  1.5 kg = 3.3 lbs ~ (3 + 5/16) lbs
  7.5 ml baking soda
  Water a bit past first knuckle?

  Boils in 15 minutes
    at high heat in giant pressure cooker at Ellen's place.
  Continues to boil even at heat = 2.
